# Global Code Standards & Behavior Rules

## Language
- Primary language for site content and UI copy is **Czech** (unless requested otherwise).

## Execution & Scope Guardrails
1. **Targeted Scope**: Make minimal surgical changes. When asked to create a section/component, generate complete markup without truncating.
2. **Match Existing Patterns**: Scan `src/` and reuse Content Collections, `site.ts`, Header nav, and section patterns.

## Layout & Spacing Architecture
- **Flexbox & Gaps over Margins**: Prefer flex/grid + `gap-*` / `gap-fluid-*`. Avoid `mt-*` / `mb-*` on siblings.
- **Section Containers**: `.container.m-auto` with flex column layouts.

### Canonical Section Pattern
```html
<section class="py-fluid-16-24 px-fluid-4-8">
  <div class="container m-auto flex flex-col gap-fluid-4-8">
    <hgroup class="flex flex-col gap-fluid-2-4">
      <span class="topper">Kategorie</span>
      <h2 class="text-fluid-2xl-5xl font-bold">Nadpis</h2>
    </hgroup>
    <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-fluid-4-8">
      <li class="flex flex-col gap-fluid-2-4">
        <!-- Use OptimizedImage for raster assets -->
        <h3 class="text-fluid-lg-2xl font-semibold">Položka</h3>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
```

## Images
- Prefer `OptimizedImage` from `src/components/OptimizedImage.astro` with a meaningful `sizes` attribute.
- Import local images from `src/assets/` so Astro can optimize them.

## CSS & Tailwind Rules
- **No arbitrary pixel values** in Tailwind classes. Use fluid tokens from `global.css`.
- Do not put project CSS into `starwind.css` — keep it theme-only.
